{"version":1,"content":"<p>市場研究機構Counterpoint Research最新發佈的數據顯示，2026年第三季度美國智能手機出貨量同比下降9%。不斷上升的內存成本對Android廠商形成壓力，尤其是利潤空間較薄的低端市場，而蘋果憑藉相對較強的抗壓能力，將市場份額提升至57%。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588180.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T07:04:04.677692+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T06:51:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T06:57:12.891815+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T06:57:12.891815+00:00","content_hash":"4c17eb4e8d81846cc42b3be89d1855e87464f79b532fb5099b233760c83ee44b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}